&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a range of questioning skills, including listening and responding in a way that builds rapport, determines customer needs and expectations and achieves&lt;span&gt;&#160;&lt;/span&gt;positive engagement and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
