&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use appropriate verbal and non-verbal communication skills, along with summarising language during face-to-face communications; and/or&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use appropriate communication skills, along with reinforcement techniques (to confirm understanding) during non-facing customer&lt;span&gt;&#160;&lt;/span&gt;interactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use an appropriate ‘tone of voice’ in all communications, including written and digital, that reflect the organisation’s brand.&lt;/li&gt;
